      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خايلهُ</span></b> , (JK, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَايَلَةٌ</span>, (S, K,)
<i>He vied with him, rivalled him,</i> or <i>imitated him,</i>
(JK, S, * K, * TA,) <i>in pride and self-conceit;</i> (JK;)
<i>did as he did.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خايلت السَّمَآءُ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّحَابُ</span>: see 2, in the latter part of the paragraph.

